.\" FreeBASIC NuttX SDK
.\" -------------------
.\" File: fbc-nuttx-esp32p4-firmware.1
.\" Purpose: Document the installed ESP32-P4 NuttX firmware builder.
.\" Responsibilities: Describe workspace preparation, configuration, and flashing.
.\" This file intentionally does not document application module deployment.
.\"
.TH FBC-NUTTX-ESP32P4-FIRMWARE 1 "2026-07-30" "FreeBASIC NuttX SDK" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbc-nuttx-esp32p4-firmware \- prepare and build NuttX firmware for ESP32-P4
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbc-nuttx-esp32p4-firmware
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbc-nuttx-esp32p4-firmware
fetches or reuses the Apache NuttX source trees, applies the compatibility
patches supplied by FreeBASIC, configures the selected ESP32-P4 board, and
builds firmware suitable for the FreeBASIC module workflow.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --workdir " DIR"
Set the directory containing the NuttX and apps source trees.
.TP
.BI --nuttx-ref " REF"
Check out the selected NuttX branch, tag, or commit.
.TP
.BI --apps-ref " REF"
Check out the selected NuttX apps revision.
.TP
.B --update
Fetch and fast-forward existing source trees.
.TP
.BI --board-config " NAME"
Select the NuttX board configuration.
.TP
.BI --out-dir " DIR"
Copy completed firmware artifacts to the specified directory.
.TP
.B --skip-patches
Do not apply the bundled compatibility patches.
.TP
.B --skip-config
Reuse the existing NuttX configuration.
.TP
.B --no-build
Stop after source preparation and configuration.
.TP
.B --flash
Flash the completed firmware.
.TP
.BI --port " DEVICE"
Select the serial or programming port used for flashing.
.TP
.BI --baud " RATE"
Set the flash transfer rate.
.TP
.B --menuconfig
Open NuttX menuconfig after scripted configuration.
.TP
.B --help
Show the complete option and environment reference.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FB_NUTTX_ESP32P4_WORKDIR, NUTTX_WORKDIR
Default workspace.
.TP
.B ESPTOOL_PORT, ESPTOOL_BAUD
Default flash device and transfer rate.
.TP
.B JOBS
Parallel build job count.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fbc-nuttx-esp32p4 (1)
.\"
.\" end of fbc-nuttx-esp32p4-firmware.1
